<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 00:33:43 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>有机外观制动组件首次亮相新款 Czinger 21C Spyder</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/organiclooking-brake-assemblies-debut-on-new-czinger-21c-spyder</link><description>Czinger 使用拓扑设计和增材制造来制造制动器。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/organiclooking-brake-assemblies-debut-on-new-czinger-21c-spyder.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 00:33:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/organiclooking-brake-assemblies-debut-on-new-czinger-21c-spyder</guid></item><item><title>SpaceX 拥有 1.4 吉瓦的在线人工智能容量，并希望明年达到 10 吉瓦。这就是为什么微软可能成为开支票的人</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/spacex-has-1-4-gigawatts-of-ai-capacity-online-and-wants-10-gigawatts-by-next-year-heres-why-microsoft-could-be-the-one-writing-the-check</link><description>SpaceX 正在寻求积极扩大其数据中心容量。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/spacex-has-1-4-gigawatts-of-ai-capacity-online-and-wants-10-gigawatts-by-next-year-heres-why-microsoft-could-be-the-one-writing-the-check.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 00:18:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/spacex-has-1-4-gigawatts-of-ai-capacity-online-and-wants-10-gigawatts-by-next-year-heres-why-microsoft-could-be-the-one-writing-the-check</guid></item><item><title>1877 年，鳟鱼开始进入优胜美地无鱼的高山湖泊。一个多世纪后，本土青蛙终于显示出复苏的迹象</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/in-1877-trout-began-entering-yosemites-fishfree-mountain-lakes-more-than-a-century-later-a-native-frog-is-finally-showing-signs-of-recovery</link><description>一个多世纪以来，优胜美地的高山湖泊成为了数百万条从未自然到达这些水域的鳟鱼的家园。鱼类放养始于 1877 年，最终将超过 3300 万条鱼放入公园，改变了没有水生掠食者的栖息地。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/in-1877-trout-began-entering-yosemites-fishfree-mountain-lakes-more-than-a-century-later-a-native-frog-is-finally-showing-signs-of-recovery.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 00:03:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/in-1877-trout-began-entering-yosemites-fishfree-mountain-lakes-more-than-a-century-later-a-native-frog-is-finally-showing-signs-of-recovery</guid></item><item><title>来自地球深处的中微子提供了地幔的新图像</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/neutrinos-from-deep-inside-earth-provide-a-new-picture-of-the-mantle</link><description>全球中微子探测器群正在创造一种前所未见的放射性元素视图，这些元素为地球的构造热机提供动力。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/neutrinos-from-deep-inside-earth-provide-a-new-picture-of-the-mantle.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 23:48:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/neutrinos-from-deep-inside-earth-provide-a-new-picture-of-the-mantle</guid></item><item><title>快与慢思考：野生鱼类揭示了两个密切相关的物种的认知如何进化</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/thinking-fast-and-slow-wild-fish-reveal-how-cognition-evolved-in-two-closely-related-species</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 23:33:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/thinking-fast-and-slow-wild-fish-reveal-how-cognition-evolved-in-two-closely-related-species</guid></item><item><title>补充米德湖需要多长时间？</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/how-long-would-it-take-to-refill-lake-mead</link><description>米德湖的水位接近历史最低点。从紧急流量削减到数十年的积雪，以下是美国最大水库重新注水所需的时间。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/how-long-would-it-take-to-refill-lake-mead.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 23:18:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/how-long-would-it-take-to-refill-lake-mead</guid></item><item><title>氯胺酮和心理治疗有望作为治疗慢性神经性疼痛的综合方法</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/ketamine-and-psychotherapy-show-promise-as-a-combined-approach-to-chronic-neuropathic-pain</link><description>多伦多大学和约克大学圣迈克尔医院的研究人员进行的一项新研究表明，将氯胺酮和心理治疗结合起来是一种安全可行的方法，对患有慢性神经性疼痛的人来说具有良好的益处。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/ketamine-and-psychotherapy-show-promise-as-a-combined-approach-to-chronic-neuropathic-pain2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 23:03:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/ketamine-and-psychotherapy-show-promise-as-a-combined-approach-to-chronic-neuropathic-pain</guid></item><item><title>细胞使用一种鲜为人知的分子来保护自己免受铁过载的影响</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/cells-use-a-little-known-molecule-to-protect-themselves-from-iron-overload</link><description>铁是必不可少的。我们的细胞需要它来产生能量，将氧气输送到全身，并为维持生命的无数化学反应提供动力。但这种金属也有阴暗的一面。当太多的游离态游离在细胞内时，就会引发破坏性反应，破坏 DNA、蛋白质甚至细胞膜。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/cells-use-a-little-known-molecule-to-protect-themselves-from-iron-overload3.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 22:48:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/cells-use-a-little-known-molecule-to-protect-themselves-from-iron-overload</guid></item><item><title>我们还没有准备好生物计算</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/were-not-ready-for-biocomputing</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 22:33:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/were-not-ready-for-biocomputing</guid></item><item><title>恶意 SIM 卡攻击：20 世纪 80 年代的缺陷如何仍然威胁工业物联网</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/malicious-sim-card-attacks-how-a-1980s-flaw-still-threatens-industrial-iot</link><description>研究人员证明，恶意 SIM 卡攻击可以在运行电动汽车充电器、工业路由器和远程信息处理单元的蜂窝调制解调器内执行攻击者代码。八个经过测试的工业模块中有六个接受了该命令。目前还没有强制性补丁，只有分散的、逐个供应商的响应。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/malicious-sim-card-attacks-how-a-1980s-flaw-still-threatens-industrial-iot.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 22:18:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/malicious-sim-card-attacks-how-a-1980s-flaw-still-threatens-industrial-iot</guid></item></channel></rss>